repository-code: "https://github.com/samyama-ai/open-problems-as-data"
abstract: >-
  A curated open-problem catalog carried in unchanged as a problem layer, under an evidence layer
  rebuilt from OpenAlex, joined by typed provenance-carrying links in one graph database. Includes
  the measurements behind two papers: the non-regression benchmark on two research fields, and a
  hand check of all 41 solves/refutes verdicts the system produced, of which 9 are correct, 30
  partly correct and 2 wrong.
keywords:
